#: docs/delivery/README.md:8
msgid "当前平台交付边界"
msgstr "Current platform delivery boundaries"

#: docs/delivery/README.md:10
msgid ""
"当前重构将生产 SoC 收敛为 STM32F4，现有 F407VE／ZG 及四个 Board 包迁入系列入口。 全部 vendor "
"来源保留；Native 移到显式测试支撑。应用任务、产品策略和私有 PCB 继续由外部工程维护。"
msgstr ""
"The current refactor narrows production SoCs to STM32F4 and moves existing "
"F407VE/ZG implementations and four Board packages into the series entry "
"point. All vendor sources are retained; Native moves to explicit test "
"support. Application tasks, product policies and private PCBs remain in "
"external projects."

#: docs/delivery/README.md:14
msgid ""
"本页说明当前阅读与验收入口，不把源码存在、文档构建或历史软件结果写成本次通过。 默认 F407 "
"路径的启动、停止、失败回滚、共享资源及诊断已由手写 C 维护，生成器负责 静态连接。后续主线是精确 F4 "
"型号扩展、所需运行期能力和真实测量，按实际回归与源码 身份验收。当前物理 HIL 为 "
"`not_executed`，本次重构没有自动建立软件候选。"
msgstr ""
"This page identifies current reading and acceptance entry points. Source"
" presence, documentation builds and historical software results are not "
"recorded as passes for this iteration. The default F407 startup, stop, "
"failure rollback, shared resources and diagnostics are maintained in "
"handwritten C; the generator provides static connections. Further work "
"covers exact F4 parts, required runtime capabilities and physical "
"measurements, accepted against actual regressions and source identity. "
"Physical HIL remains `not_executed`; this refactor creates no software "
"candidate automatically."

#: docs/delivery/README.md:18
msgid ""
"[Host C11 配置器](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tools/nxconfig/README.md)是在 PC 上运行的可选试点，默认平台 配置仍使用 "
"Python。试点不进入固件，其全面替换不作为平台使用、固件 C 化或软件 交付的前置条件。它改变的是主机工具实现，不直接改变 MCU "
"热路径或资源占用。"
msgstr ""
"The [Host C11 configuration tool](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/nxconfig/README.md) is an "
"optional pilot that runs on a PC; the default platform configuration still "
"uses Python. The pilot does not enter firmware. Replacing the host tool "
"completely is not a prerequisite for using the platform, moving firmware "
"behavior to C, or delivering software. It changes the host tool "
"implementation and does not directly change MCU hot paths or resource use."

