#: docs/delivery/README.md:27
msgid ""
"当前源码版本号保持 0.2.1；已发布版本仍以 [GitHub Releases](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/releases)和其固定 manifest 为准。 重构不移动旧标签，不重新标记旧产物。"
msgstr ""
"The current source version remains 0.2.1. Published versions are defined by "
"[GitHub Releases](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/releases) and their "
"fixed manifests. The refactor does not move existing tags or relabel old "
"artifacts."

#: docs/delivery/README.md:31
msgid ""
"退出平台的原始实现和记录可从 [重构前固定源码](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/tree/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18) "
"追溯。原日志、来源和状态保持原身份，恢复或阅读它们不授予新源码资格。"
msgstr ""
"Retired implementations and records remain traceable at the [fixed pre-"
"refactor source](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/tree/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18). Original logs, "
"sources and states retain their identities; restoring or reading them does "
"not qualify the new source."
